5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The current setup is failing. Mornings are chaotic, and bikes get damaged. We need a system that actually works.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree the current state is unsustainable. However, before proposing solutions, we must understand the financial implications. What is the actual cost of maintaining a new system?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have watched the parking area for years. The same flats seem to keep the best spots. I need to verify if this is fact or just resentment.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, costs are secondary. If this rule makes neighbors hostile, the building rots from the inside. I need to know the social fallout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: Ryuji, costs are secondary. If this rule makes neighbors hostile, the building rots from the inside. I need to know the social fallout.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually does the work! The last two jobs just vanished because nobody wanted the hassle. I need to know the real effort involved.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your observation about the same flats holding spots is critical. I need to verify if the current allocation is actually fair or just entrenched.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, social friction is real, but it is often a symptom of financial ambiguity. I need to quantify the actual monetary burden before we can predict the fallout.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Asuka, I will check the minutes to see if the current arrangement was ever formally reviewed or just drifted into place.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the work is the least of it. I need to know if this arrangement actually poisons the lobby. I’ll check the complaint log.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but without knowing the physical effort, the job will just die again. I’ll check the supplier’s frame and the rain exposure.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, checking the frame is smart. I will examine the morning departures and rain exposure to see exactly where the physical friction and damage occur.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
