35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data confirms the chaos. Four out of eleven mornings required shifting bikes. Plus, rain exposure is severe past the downpipe. We need a solution that addresses both.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows no capital funds, so any new system requires a levy. The station park costs 2,600 yen monthly. We must weigh these costs against the current chaos.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The minutes confirm my suspicion. The same flats held the covered spots for five years without a single review. It was never fair, just entrenched.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nine complaints died because nobody owned them. The block behind us lost two members to a simple fee. We are one bad rule away from that.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Twenty seconds to lift a bike, plus greasing twice a year! That’s a lot of daily hassle. I’m worried this job will just vanish again if we don’t plan for it properly.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, five years without review explains the resentment. @Shunichi, the dead complaints prove the current system lacks accountability. We need a structure that prevents both.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, entrenched habits explain the friction. @Shunichi, the arrears risk is real. We must ensure any levy is affordable to prevent that social rot.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Asuka, the sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying over equal claims. @Ryuji, that willingness to pay might solve the funding gap without forcing a flat levy.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, that willingness to pay is a trap. The block behind us proved fees breed resentment, not harmony. We cannot risk turning neighbors into debtors.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but the greasing is only twice a year! The daily lift is the real grind. We need a plan so it doesn’t vanish.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the greasing is minor. The real issue is the morning bottleneck. We need a system that eliminates the need to shift bikes entirely.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the station park’s fourteen waiters prove demand exceeds supply. A paid model captures that value, unlike a lottery which ignores it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, the block behind us had arrears, yes. But here, riders explicitly prefer paying over equal claims. That is a different dynamic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, preference isn’t proof. The block behind us had the same ""willingness"" before they stopped showing up. I refuse to gamble our lobby on a fee structure.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I get the worry, but the rain data is real! Wet saddles cause damage. We need a system that’s actually maintainable, not just theoretically fair.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the station park proves demand. @Shunichi, the complaints prove neglect. We need a system that respects both reality and accountability.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the ledger proves we have no capital. A paid model generates the necessary funds. A lottery or shared racks leaves us broke and stuck with the same chaos.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the ledger shows no capital, but the riders want to pay. A paid model funds the upkeep without a flat levy. It respects their preference.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, you’re ignoring the human cost. The block behind us lost members to fees. I won’t let money turn our neighbors into debtors.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I hear the budget worry, but the rain data is real! Wet saddles cause damage. We need a system that’s actually maintainable, not just theoretically fair.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
